\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1559519_10152106833954487_1160439146_o.jpg\" alt=\"1559519_10152106833954487_1160439146_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/v\/t1.0-9\/p206x206\/540100_10151506610509487_1660143585_n.jpg?oh=378193bed634e7fc6ef62cd87172ccf5&amp;amp;oe=55F38737\" alt=\"540100_10151506610509487_1660143585_n.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1898049,"PostDate":1433725171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement, Rhonda3839 and welcome to our forum community <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> You'll find lots of great advice, ideas, suggestions and support from everyone here, so well done on finding us!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For some further inspiration, here are a few magical beach wedding \"moments that matter\" our premier photograher, Linc captured at some recent Mayan Riviera weddings......Enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10153360211499487.1073741932.18683524486&type=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>RUI Yucatan Playacar Wedding Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11312888_10153360212899487_3185437363785761513_o.jpg\" alt=\"11312888_10153360212899487_3185437363785\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xta1\/t31.0-8\/11270484_10153360212794487_3962152744924471433_o.jpg\" alt=\"11270484_10153360212794487_3962152744924\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11235450_10153360215944487_75064290117880840_o.jpg\" alt=\"11235450_10153360215944487_7506429011788\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....or these from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150695320839487.414941.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Cover Photos: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xat1\/t31.0-8\/11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044648467_o.jpg\" alt=\"11334252_10153357324994487_6025654323044\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1559519_10152106833954487_1160439146_o.jpg\" alt=\"1559519_10152106833954487_1160439146_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research, and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-ord1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn2\/v\/t1.0-9\/p206x206\/540100_10151506610509487_1660143585_n.jpg?oh=378193bed634e7fc6ef62cd87172ccf5&oe=55F38737\" alt=\"540100_10151506610509487_1660143585_n.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79253","Title":"Hard Rock Punta Cana","LastPostDate":1433725171},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
