> User Rhonda3839 (283419)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":315,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1896536,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1431978343,"LastPoster":{"Id":279978,"Name":"JJCB0418","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":60,"Preview":{"Id":1896536,"PostDate":1431978343,"PostContent":"My fiance and I are doing our own vows. I like what I wrote but I feel like it's too short. At th...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403550989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.21.46.58","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"aa2b41c19fa81886e691c6c662151345","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I are doing our own vows. I like what I wrote but I feel like it&#039;s too short. At the same time, I don&#039;t want to write a book. Here&#039;s what I&#039;ve got. Anyone have suggestions? Feedback?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I can still see you so clearly in my mind walking towards me at the start of our first date. I remember thinking \u2018wow,\u2019 he\u2019s so cute! Then one week later you started talking about marrying me, and \u2018wow\u2019 went to \u2018whoa!\u2019 I don\u2019t know why I didn\u2019t run at that point. Most people probably would have. But &lt;em&gt;not &lt;\/em&gt;running was the greatest decision I ever made because if I had, I would\u2019ve missed out on finding my best friend. I would\u2019ve missed out on spending my life with the guy I get a little sad about leaving every morning, and excited to see when I come home. And I\u2019d never have the privilege of becoming your wife today.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So now I promise you this. I promise to always make us my priority. I promise to always be your cheerleader and stand behind you. I promise to throw out your socks when they have holes in them without telling you, but also to continue confiding in you about everything else. I will always believe in you, be there for you and cherish every moment we have together. But most importantly, I promise to love you forever.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896536,"PostDate":1431978343,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My fiance and I are doing our own vows. I like what I wrote but I feel like it's too short. At the same time, I don't want to write a book. Here's what I've got. Anyone have suggestions? Feedback?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I can still see you so clearly in my mind walking towards me at the start of our first date. I remember thinking \u2018wow,\u2019 he\u2019s so cute! Then one week later you started talking about marrying me, and \u2018wow\u2019 went to \u2018whoa!\u2019 I don\u2019t know why I didn\u2019t run at that point. Most people probably would have. But <em>not <\/em>running was the greatest decision I ever made because if I had, I would\u2019ve missed out on finding my best friend. I would\u2019ve missed out on spending my life with the guy I get a little sad about leaving every morning, and excited to see when I come home. And I\u2019d never have the privilege of becoming your wife today.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So now I promise you this. I promise to always make us my priority. I promise to always be your cheerleader and stand behind you. I promise to throw out your socks when they have holes in them without telling you, but also to continue confiding in you about everything else. I will always believe in you, be there for you and cherish every moment we have together. But most importantly, I promise to love you forever.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403550989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8df8f69657d3733eabe3088f17fc1f65","RawContent":"I think it&#039;s perfect :)\n\n\nHaha men and their holy socks!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1896539,"PostDate":1431979461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think it's perfect <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nHaha men and their holy socks!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399432202,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.126.252.6","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1c2517af978702fc7ffb0bb25a63cdf9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I think they are perfect!! I don&#039;t know you guys but they are very personal and emotional :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Haha, I&#039;m the one with the holey socks and Juan throws them out for me haha&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I still have to write mine and have no idea what to say!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896575,"PostDate":1432046454,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I think they are perfect!! I don't know you guys but they are very personal and emotional <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Haha, I'm the one with the holey socks and Juan throws them out for me haha\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I still have to write mine and have no idea what to say!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<br><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/'><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;31;484\/st\/20150813\/e\/Wedding+time%21+\/dt\/-2\/k\/b92c\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\">\u00a0","Email":"sblopezb@gmail.com","IpAddress":"172.219.193.22","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1359766704,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265511.jpg?_r=1427386564","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":153,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TinkerSofi","Id":265511,"Name":"TinkerSofi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c977cec3e962f61c552dfe344d7f970f","RawContent":"@[member=\"jeffandrobyn\"] I think they are great length. Time them out. I think about a minute is what was recommended when I looked up writing mine. ours were just under a minute each. Good luck! Vows can be tough \nHere was the ones I wrote for him. We just got married at the Riu on the 9th! Hope it can help. I googled how to write vows and you can find great tips and a format to follow. We both followed the same format so the vows would flow for both. \n\n\nJay, ten years ago I walked into the Hollywood Bistro. What I expected was to have a few drinks with friends  but what happened was so much more. I met a man who respected me. I met a man with goals and dreams that matched mine. I met a man who loved cats, a man who gives so much more than he receives. A man who tucks me in at at night and kisses my head before he leaves for work in the morning. A man who makes me laugh harder than anyone else.  \n\n\nI met a man who always says thank you. And that man is you. So today I want to thank you. Thank you for being my partner, my inspiration and my heart. For always lifting me up when I feel down. For taking the time to ask me how I am and listening to the answer. For making me want to be better.  \n\n\nI promise to never take you for granted. Every day with you is a gift that I look forward to opening. I promise to be honest with you as I always have. I promise to be your biggest fan. I promise to make you proud that I am your wife. And most importantly I promise never to let myself go. \n\n\nI look forward to growing old with you. To reaching every goal we set together. From running our first marathon to retiring in Florida. \n\n\nYou are my best friend, my lover and now my husband.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896576,"PostDate":1432047076,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278661\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278661-jeffandrobyn\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jeffandrobyn<\/span><\/a> I think they are great length. Time them out. I think about a minute is what was recommended when I looked up writing mine. ours were just under a minute each. Good luck! Vows can be tough <br \/>Here was the ones I wrote for him. We just got married at the Riu on the 9th! Hope it can help. I googled how to write vows and you can find great tips and a format to follow. We both followed the same format so the vows would flow for both. <br><br>\nJay, ten years ago I walked into the Hollywood Bistro. What I expected was to have a few drinks with friends  but what happened was so much more. I met a man who respected me. I met a man with goals and dreams that matched mine. I met a man who loved cats, a man who gives so much more than he receives. A man who tucks me in at at night and kisses my head before he leaves for work in the morning. A man who makes me laugh harder than anyone else.  <br><br>\nI met a man who always says thank you. And that man is you. So today I want to thank you. Thank you for being my partner, my inspiration and my heart. For always lifting me up when I feel down. For taking the time to ask me how I am and listening to the answer. For making me want to be better.  <br><br>\nI promise to never take you for granted. Every day with you is a gift that I look forward to opening. I promise to be honest with you as I always have. I promise to be your biggest fan. I promise to make you proud that I am your wife. And most importantly I promise never to let myself go. <br><br>\nI look forward to growing old with you. To reaching every goal we set together. From running our first marathon to retiring in Florida. <br><br>\nYou are my best friend, my lover and now my husband.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Meggan.Kole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385156577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Megg","Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.21.46.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"17ac97f7d7259e5cc794c7ca5b3eb4bb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Megg\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wow! Your vows are so beautiful that they made me tear up - and I don&#039;t even know you!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing. And congrats on your wedding!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896579,"PostDate":1432049088,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275259\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275259-megg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Megg<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wow! Your vows are so beautiful that they made me tear up - and I don't even know you!!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks for sharing. And congrats on your wedding!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403550989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72f5a77517db8d1b46bc5bd98160a248","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jeffandrobyn\" post=\"1896579\" timestamp=\"1432045488\"]\n@[member=\"Megg\"]\n \nWow! Your vows are so beautiful that they made me tear up - and I don&#039;t even know you!!!! \n \nThanks for sharing. And congrats on your wedding!\n[\/quote]Thank you! I love yours as well. Very personal which is all that matters. Vows are for your partner.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896582,"PostDate":1432050810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>jeffandrobyn, on 19 May 2015 - 07:24 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275259\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275259-megg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Megg<\/span><\/a><br>\n\u00a0<br>\nWow! Your vows are so beautiful that they made me tear up - and I don't even know you!!!!\u00a0<br>\n\u00a0<br>\nThanks for sharing. And congrats on your wedding!<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nThank you! I love yours as well. Very personal which is all that matters. Vows are for your partner. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Meggan.Kole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385156577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Megg","Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.21.46.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8a35b1bb28568748b36bd78b77f886e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Megg\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I borrowed your &#039;life is a gift&#039; line. It was so beautiful.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896585,"PostDate":1432050901,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"275259\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/275259-megg\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Megg<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I borrowed your 'life is a gift' line. It was so beautiful.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"robynbrooke81@gmail.com","IpAddress":"75.99.18.219","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1403550989,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278661.jpg?_r=1404161707","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeffandrobyn","Id":278661,"Name":"jeffandrobyn","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4249b4d9386685717dd405e9cceeb763","RawContent":"@[member=\"jeffandrobyn\"] \n\n\nNo problem! That&#039;s why I posted them. I would have been lost without this site planning our wedding! All of the brides on her were so helpful to me.","Attachments":[],"Id":1896612,"PostDate":1432068757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278661\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278661-jeffandrobyn\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">jeffandrobyn<\/span><\/a> <br><br>\nNo problem! That's why I posted them. I would have been lost without this site planning our wedding! All of the brides on her were so helpful to me. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Meggan.Kole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.82.4.242","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1385156577,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275259.jpg?_r=1421618186","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":113,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Megg","Id":275259,"Name":"Megg","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"171.161.160.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79195,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10be3d2d4bbd90e73c96a2aec630f925","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What you wrote is beautiful.&amp;nbsp; I wouldn&#039;t worry so much about the format or length as long as you say what&#039;s on your heart.&amp;nbsp;I wouldn&#039;t go on for too long since people will be sitting in the beautiful sun!&amp;nbsp; Mine were a bit longer (probably a little over 2 minutes) and his were really short (less than a minute), but I said everything I wanted and didn&#039;t walk away feeling \"I should have said...\"&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I actually wrote mine the day before by the pool!&amp;nbsp; haha&amp;nbsp; Obviously, it&#039;s something I had been thinking about for a very long time so I had ideas of what I wanted to say, but just needed to put it on paper.&amp;nbsp; I didn&#039;t do any research ahead of time about how to write them, for me it would have confused me and made me think about it in a more calculated way....but that&#039;s just me! Plus, I&#039;ve been to a few weddings and have watched a million tv\/movie weddings so maybe that was my research.&amp;nbsp; :D&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1896788,"PostDate":1432237929,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What you wrote is beautiful.\u00a0 I wouldn't worry so much about the format or length as long as you say what's on your heart.\u00a0I wouldn't go on for too long since people will be sitting in the beautiful sun!\u00a0 Mine were a bit longer (probably a little over 2 minutes) and his were really short (less than a minute), but I said everything I wanted and didn't walk away feeling \"I should have said...\"\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I actually wrote mine the day before by the pool!\u00a0 haha\u00a0 Obviously, it's something I had been thinking about for a very long time so I had ideas of what I wanted to say, but just needed to put it on paper.\u00a0 I didn't do any research ahead of time about how to write them, for me it would have confused me and made me think about it in a more calculated way....but that's just me! Plus, I've been to a few weddings and have watched a million tv\/movie weddings so maybe that was my research.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jenique.brown@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"171.159.64.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1411575695,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"JJCB0418","Id":279978,"Name":"JJCB0418","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79195","Title":"Vows: How Long, What To Include And Opinions","LastPostDate":1432237929},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
