e":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5c1fbfa2c40bfbd6640c4e54051b8b7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I love the maracas! Super cute idea.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856148,"PostDate":1403196422,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I love the maracas! Super cute idea.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"chrystae@jwfloors.com","IpAddress":"67.124.208.162","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400781812,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278076.jpg?_r=1423063276","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Chrysta","Id":278076,"Name":"Chrysta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"186.77.132.163","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ac606a28dff8891dc2aecdb809be1f9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I got them in Nicaragua. From a local vendor, but I bet most Latin American destinations have vendors like him.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1856848,"PostDate":1403705244,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I got them in Nicaragua. From a local vendor, but I bet most Latin American destinations have vendors like him.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bel.maria.g@gmail.com","IpAddress":"186.77.139.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1397335710,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277561.jpg?_r=1401300550","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"cubanaboliviana","Id":277561,"Name":"cubanaboliviana","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d1472a07359bb9e0ab7b60af6f05f7f","RawContent":"[quote name=\"A7Xtrish\" post=\"1854286\" timestamp=\"1402198352\"]\nThought I&#039;d share (: cute idea.. ! [img]http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif[\/img][url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&amp;amp;module=attach&amp;amp;section=attach&amp;amp;attach_rel_module=post&amp;amp;attach_id=28200\"]uploadfromtaptalk1402198131860.jpg[\/url]\n\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk\nStill learning this new galaxy phone. I&#039;ve had an iPhone forever gr! For those who cannot view any attachments:\n[url=\"https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/153014170\/beach-key-chain-beach-wedding-favor-may\"]https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/153014170\/beach-key-chain-beach-wedding-favor-may[\/url]\n\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThat&#039;s funny! I had an iphone too, for 3 years. Hated every second of it! I just upgraded to the Samsung S4. LUVIN IT!!!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1856873,"PostDate":1403718184,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>A7Xtrish, on 07 June 2014 - 08:32 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Thought I'd share (: cute idea.. ! <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/attachicon.gif\" alt=\"attachicon.gif\"><\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=core&module=attach&section=attach&attach_rel_module=post&attach_id=28200' class='bbc_url' title=''>uploadfromtaptalk1402198131860.jpg<\/a><br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk<br>\nStill learning this new galaxy phone. I've had an iPhone forever gr! For those who cannot view any attachments:<br><a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/listing\/153014170\/beach-key-chain-beach-wedding-favor-may' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...dding-favor-may<\/a><br><br>\nSent from my SPH-L720T using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That's funny! I had an iphone too, for 3 years. Hated every second of it! I just upgraded to the Samsung S4. LUVIN IT!!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283462599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.210.76.13","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1403721544,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5480a6a71307c3c7a038cf3e5117b8cc","RawContent":"I think we&#039;re doing maracas and hot sauce! \n\n\nThe maracas well get from amols (cheapest) and well put one on each plate for colour with the \"Shake for a kiss\" tag. \n\n\nWe just grabbed a bunch of different hot sauces to try from the mall nearby our hotel.  We&#039;re going to try them out at home and then pick them up the week of our wedding if they&#039;re good and put thank you tags on them. We&#039;re going to get a variety and put them all on a table for our guests to pick up. And well get some fun Mexican toys for the kids","Attachments":[],"Id":1856877,"PostDate":1403721496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I think we're doing maracas and hot sauce! <br><br>\nThe maracas well get from amols (cheapest) and well put one on each plate for colour with the \"Shake for a kiss\" tag. <br><br>\nWe just grabbed a bunch of different hot sauces to try from the mall nearby our hotel.  We're going to try them out at home and then pick them up the week of our wedding if they're good and put thank you tags on them. We're going to get a variety and put them all on a table for our guests to pick up. And well get some fun Mexican toys for the kids\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395612948,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.186.70.125","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64c0e698ba657b83aa1b0f47c947c447","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1856873\" timestamp=\"1403714584\"]\nThat&#039;s funny! I had an iphone too, for 3 years. Hated every second of it! I just upgraded to the Samsung S4. LUVIN IT!!!!![\/quote]Lol. All I ever did was complain about my iphone. Now I love this s4 but it&#039;s so different I&#039;m slowly figuring it out lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1857118,"PostDate":1403842626,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 25 June 2014 - 09:43 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>That's funny! I had an iphone too, for 3 years. Hated every second of it! I just upgraded to the Samsung S4. LUVIN IT!!!!!<\/p><\/div><\/div>\nLol. All I ever did was complain about my iphone. Now I love this s4 but it's so different I'm slowly figuring it out lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">trishhh. <\/span><3\u00a0<span style=\"color:#ff3366;\">Now Jade, 09.23.2014<\/span>","Email":"patricia_ladd@aol.com","IpAddress":"24.186.69.44","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1382752474,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274569.jpg?_r=1402198559","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"A7Xtrish","Id":274569,"Name":"A7Xtrish","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.199.68","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d2e1bf8f5936e81eccdedea77de795d3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are doing insulated cups\/water bottles and in the oot bags we are also putting a small bottle of overproof rum and some jamaican handmade sweeties.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1857892,"PostDate":1404315773,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are doing insulated cups\/water bottles and in the oot bags we are also putting a small bottle of overproof rum and some jamaican handmade sweeties.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spadeincwedding@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396405780,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"NixSpade","Id":277449,"Name":"NixSpade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"173.8.177.213","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8e80efee9aedebefba907cde388d377","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Las maracas are lovely!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1863665,"PostDate":1406832053,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Las maracas are lovely!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Love over 50 is still LOVE!!!<\/p>\n<p>Invitations out! RSVPs in<\/p>\n<p>Us, them (bridal party), + 48 guests!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"dldincali@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.8.177.213","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1399067737,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277818.jpg?_r=1408642386","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":143,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"VegasBride121314","Id":277818,"Name":"VegasBride121314","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.165.85.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"094c5c1eb9c12833786c8ac8d3d84b36","RawContent":"Love the maracas too but FI nixed that idea.. says we have enough stuff :( \n\naalso absolutely love the key chain but kind of expensive and im sure he won&#039;t go for that now lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1864447,"PostDate":1407172635,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Love the maracas too but FI nixed that idea.. says we have enough stuff <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> <br>\naalso absolutely love the key chain but kind of expensive and im sure he won't go for that now lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"crazycdngirl26@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"71.17.139.242","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344506438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258970.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MJTK","Id":258970,"Name":"MJTK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":77073,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6c802ea7dd9b4bfe98b21deb3a2952ad","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re getting married in December so giving a box with: homemade sea salt, sea shell topped wine bottle stopper, and &amp;nbsp;silver starfish ornament &amp;nbsp;Can&#039;t wait for the DIY to begin, I need to get on it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865195,"PostDate":1407513006,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We're getting married in December so giving a box with: homemade sea salt, sea shell topped wine bottle stopper, and \u00a0silver starfish ornament \u00a0Can't wait for the DIY to begin, I need to get on it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"spj.wedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.142.197.104","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407354954,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279330.jpg?_r=1407431220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"spjwedding","Id":279330,"Name":"spjwedding","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":34,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
